# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale fr
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [12:00, 18:00).
# The hyphenated surface is tokenizer-canonicalised to "après midi" (the
# hyphen splits into two tokens the loader re-glues); ascii-folded twin kept
# for the same reason clock_meridiem_pm.voc keeps one.
après-midi
apres-midi
